WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.830
Precure Love Link!

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.510
Brimming with love,

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.820
Cure Heart!

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.070
Cure... Heart...

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.860
Cure Heart!

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.580
A new Precure has been born!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.550
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.580
Every day it sparkles

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:50.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:55.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.470
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:06.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:12.620
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:21.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:23.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:31.200
What's more than just cute

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.070
is our promise between girls

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:41.110
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:47.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:51.090
{part a}

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:59.550
Dundundun!

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:59.550
Dundundun!

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:02.690
Hey, since when was there another one?

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:05.140
She may be a new recruit.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.040
Talk about a pain...

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.080
Why you—

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.250
<i>This chick...</i>

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.580
<i>I'm light!</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.370
What are you doing?

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.590
<i>My body's moving heart-wrenchingly fast!</i>

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.050
Guess I jumped too far.

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:43.780
Got you!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.730
You threw me off!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:48.480
No, <i>you</i> did!

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.190
Now I'm mad!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.120
Selfish!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.820
Selfish!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.410
Just kidding, Selfiselfiselfiselfi!

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:08.280
If you fight any more,

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:11.600
your friend here might fall head over heels for you.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.540
Wait, you can do that?

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.110
Man, you're dim.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.240
The entire world revolves around King Selfish!

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.140
So we can use any underhanded tricks we want!

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.850
You're the dim ones!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:33.120
That girl and I aren't friends or anything of the sort.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.630
If you think that girl

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.380
would throw her life away to save mine,

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.280
you're gravely mistaken!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.460
What did you say?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.010
Self!

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.050
What?!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.050
Cure Heart!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:07.690
Cure Sword!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.970
Self!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.170
But why?

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.100
You don't need a reason to help people!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.390
Self! Selfyself Seeelf!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.080
Selfyselfalling!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.210
Selfy!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.720
Help me!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:12.360
<i>This should give birth to an excellent Selfish!</i>

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:17.500
<i>Could it be that the Selfish wasn't going berserk by choice?</i>

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.930
<i>Maybe it was forced into that form and didn't know what to do!</i>

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.470
<i>If so, I have to help!</i>

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:28.910
This light...

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.040
The Cure Lovies...

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.120
Sharuru, let's go!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.080
Sharuru!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:50.160
From me to you, {It sounds kind of Valentine-esque, so let's go with this.}

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.660
My Sweet Heart!

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.270
Love love looooove!

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.680
This girl... purified a Selfish...

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.050
She did it!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.380
Ha ha, you got wrecked!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.500
Quiet, you!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.020
It flew away.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.960
That's a Psyche, a human heart.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:21.630
Heart?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:27.510
Everyone has self-centered feelings budding in their hearts.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:30.940
People try not to give in to those feelings,

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:36.670
but the Selfish strengthen those self-centered thoughts and turn them into monsters!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.320
I see...

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.370
Hello there!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.590
I'm Cure Heart!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.280
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.580
I thank you for saving me,

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.520
but don't let it go to your head.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.180
As I said before,

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:04.270
you and I aren't friends or anything of the sort.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.440
But we fought together, so we're partners!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.010
We're practically friends!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.810
You can't fight with that attitude.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:12.470
Huh?

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.450
When they attack with their full strength,

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.530
will you be able to protect those dear to you?

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.160
Hey, wait!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.250
I still need to ask...

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.270
Um...

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:28.090
How do I get my regular clothes back? {lit. "Go back to normal form". This is slightly more self-aware.}

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.200
Why didn't you team up with her?

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.060
If you have a partner, we can search more—

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.480
Be quiet, Dabyi!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.360
I don't need a partner!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.940
Mana!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:44.860
Aida!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.040
Are you all right?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.030
No injuries?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.280
What about that crab monster?

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.070
Eh, I don't really know...

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:52.920
Huh?

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:55.590
But dude, this elevator hall...

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.560
wasn't it totally busted up?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.500
I-It might've been!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.130
Maybe it was all a dream?

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.910
Well, you're safe, and that's what counts.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.630
Let's return to the bus.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:07.860
Yeah!

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.360
I'm beat!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.510
I knew today would have way too much to deal with!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:17.960
It most certainly did, Happy Prince.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.240
Who's that?

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:22.240
Long ago, on a street corner far away,

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.170
a statue with eyes of sapphire, buttons of ruby,

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.960
and a coat of gold stood in the image of a prince.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.010
The prince asked a favor of a swallow.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.120
O Swallow,

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.190
give to the impoverished citizens of this town

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:38.430
one piece of my body each!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.350
A fairy tale? {Wrong season bitch, tell that to Miyuki.}

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.320
Yes.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.540
You've always been just like that prince, Mana.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.770
You always try to make other people happy,

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:47.540
no matter how much it wears you down.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.550
Aw, it doesn't wear me down much.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.940
But there's something you still haven't told me.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.030
What? How'd you know?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.530
I haven't been your friend for ten years for nothing.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.390
Tell me.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.640
Well, as long as you don't flip out.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.640
The truth is...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.830
I transformed into a Precure.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.160
Come again?

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:17.100
A fairy from the Trump Kingdom gave me a mysterious power.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.410
I used that power to transform,

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.490
and I fought a bunch of selfish people!

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.770
Well, I chased a white rabbit down a hole,

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.790
and exposed the truth of a hidden world.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.490
I'm not lying!

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:29.630
Mana!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.960
Welcome back.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.250
Welcome home!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.630
I'm home!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.280
Oh, welcome, Rikka!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.340
Welcome.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.280
Nice to see you. {God this is painful to translate.}

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.270
Mana, we'll continue this tomorrow.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.810
Huh? Wait!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.730
Are you sure you want to go without dinner?

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.800
I'm fine!

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:50.840
Goodbye!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.370
Goodbye!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.610
Wait, Rikka!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.990
diner

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.990
Pig's Tail

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.350
Thanks for the food.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.990
Seeya, Mana.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.200
Thank you for coming!

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:14.260
I figured Rikka would've been the one person who'd believe me...

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:21.390
Then again, I barely believe it myself,

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:24.160
so of course nobody else would.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:28.310
What've you been muttering about all day?

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.940
Guess I'm at that age where you have tons of problems.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.650
Times like these call for piping hot food!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.570
It's...

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.700
Your daddy's own special omelette rice. {Sounds like a top-tier Cure dad.}

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.850
Now, eat up!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.450
Don't mind if I do!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.890
It's so yummy!

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:53.880
Nothing gets my heart racing like this!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.340
Now you're finally back to normal.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.300
Huh?

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.280
I don't know what's been on your mind,

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:04.620
but if you're not brimming with energy, we all worry.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.480
Not just your mother and I,

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.280
but your grandpa and Rikka, too.

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.100
You're right.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:13.980
Daddy, can I ask you for something?

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.640
Meow!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.960
What do you need at this hour?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.010
Peach buns!

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.580
Daddy steamed them!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.410
Wait, I'm coming down!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.700
<i>I'll be honest with her</i>

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.560
<i>Rikka should understand then.</i>

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:39.210
You must not speak of the Precure's secret...

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.090
Huh?

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.130
I'm here!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.470
Mana?

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:09.910
Who are you?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.900
Heheheh...

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.370
Ta-dah!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.010
They multiplied.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:16.530
I'm Raquel!

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.170
I'm Lance!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.650
We're all fairies from Trump Kingdom!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.570
Hello there, I'm Aida Mana.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:28.400
Oh yeah, I need to explain Precures to Rikka,

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.010
so you all can help.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.220
You can't tell her that.

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:33.060
Why not?

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.670
You can't tell anyone about the existence of the Precures!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.070
Why not?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:42.600
The Selfish will dye more peoples' hearts in darkness!

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:45.670
The only ones who can stop them are...

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:47.770
the le... legendary...

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:48.720
Warriors!

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.570
Yeah! The Precure warriors!

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.380
And you're one of them, Mana!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:56.460
I understand that, but why can't I talk about it?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.250
The Selfish plan to extend their dark rule to this world!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:05.560
Anyone you tell the secret to will be dragged into the fight!

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:09.520
<i>When they attack with their full strength,</i>

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.400
<i>will you be able to protect those dear to you?</i>

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:13.460
I get it.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:14.480
I won't say a thing.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.910
Thank goodness!

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.040
<i>I can't drag Rikka into something this dangerous...</i>

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.120
Good.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.270
I'm off!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.660
Have a nice day.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.730
Good morning.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.330
Good morning!

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:46.920
Did those two fight or somethin'?

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.040
Beats me.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.320
Thanks for last night's snacks.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.510
Huh? Oh, how were they?

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.320
They were great.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.480
Too bad we couldn't eat together.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.150
Mana...

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.960
Wh-What?

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:10.490
I still don't know what you've been hiding.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.600
But if you ever want to talk, be honest with me.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.950
I'm always here.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.270
Good morning!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.740
Mornin'!

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:24.610
Good morning!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:26.480
Good morning.

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.600
Top of the mornin'! {I think this is supposed to be some weird accent or crazy slang.}

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.970
Mornin'...

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.170
The prez looks bummed out.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:34.950
She oughta do that more often. {Still an asshole in episode two. I love it.}

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.730
What's up?

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.540
I gotta spill it!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:47.590
Wha?!

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.760
I can't hide anything from Rikka!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.780
I'll tell it all!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.200
Y-You can't!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.020
Rikka!

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:56.170
You wanna drag your friend into this fight?!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.280
Frickin' A, I'm late! {The kids say this nowadays, right?}

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.600
And now I get stuck <i>again</i>!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.010
I ain't gonna make it!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.880
If I could change the lights to how I want 'em,

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.760
I could totally make it in time.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.430
Nah, I shoulda just woken up earlier.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.540
Aw, just change the lights.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:24.900
Who was that?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.170
I'm here to grant your desire.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.350
Go berserk!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:45.210
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.000
Selfish!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.930
How dare you cross my road!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.270
Stop!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.840
Stop!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.420
What's that?

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.850
Stop!

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:10.180
This street belongs to me!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:14.320
You need to lie for her sake!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.390
But...

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:16.870
Aah!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.970
Stop!

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.150
That's...

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:24.960
President!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.030
Mana!

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.420
It's a Selfish!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.400
Self!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.510
Don't worry, everyone.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.930
I'll figure something out!

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:36.220
Rikka, hide everyone in a safe place!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.140
What about you?

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.470
Mana, what will you do?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.410
I'll stop that traffic light!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.140
You Happy Prince!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.120
Huh?

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.020
Even that prince statue standing on the corner

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:52.460
needed a swallow to give out his gold to the people!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:55.530
Won't you let me be your swallow?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.310
Rikka...

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.740
Help me!

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:07.500
Yeah.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.170
This road belongs to me!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.630
Huh?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.180
Here goes!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:18.600
Self!

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:23.510
Everyone! Run away while you can!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.390
